            <h1 class="display-3 fw-bold lh-sm mb-3">Build polished .NET 10 product pages with stock Bootstrap only.</h1>
            <p class="lead text-body-secondary mb-4">BlazorExpress gives you a clean Razor Pages starting point with a structured landing page, Bootstrap utilities and components, and no custom CSS to maintain.</p>
            <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row gap-3 mb-4">
                <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg px-4" href="#features">Explore the sections</a>
                <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-lg px-4" href="https://learn.microsoft.com/aspnet/core/razor-pages/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Read Razor Pages docs</a>
            </div>
            <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-sm-3 g-3">
                <div class="col">
                    <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">Styling model</p>
                            <p class="h5 mb-0">Bootstrap classes only</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col">
                    <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">Platform</p>
                            <p class="h5 mb-0">ASP.NET Core Web App</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col">
                    <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">Language target</p>
                            <p class="h5 mb-0">.NET 10 and C# 14</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-5 col-xxl-5 offset-xxl-1">
            <div class="card border-0 shadow-lg">
                <div class="card-body p-4 p-lg-5">
                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start mb-4">
                        <div>
                            <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">Launch profile</p>
                            <h2 class="h3 mb-0">Marketing-ready app shell</h2>
                        </div>
                        <span class="badge text-bg-success">Ready</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-sm-2 g-3 mb-4">
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="border rounded-3 h-100 p-3">
                                <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">Hero</p>
                                <p class="mb-0">Strong headline, primary CTA, and quick trust signals.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="border rounded-3 h-100 p-3">
                                <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">Sections</p>
                                <p class="mb-0">Feature grid, platform overview, proof points, and resources.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="border rounded-3 h-100 p-3">
                                <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">Dependencies</p>
                                <p class="mb-0">Bootstrap from CDN with no local theme layer or custom scripts.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="border rounded-3 h-100 p-3">
                                <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">Delivery</p>
                                <p class="mb-0">Focused markup that stays easy to iterate in Razor Pages.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="list-group list-group-flush border rounded-3">
                        <div class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center py-3">
                            <span class="text-body-secondary">UI framework</span>
                            <span class="fw-semibold">Bootstrap 5.3.8</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center py-3">
                            <span class="text-body-secondary">Runtime</span>
                            <span class="fw-semibold">net10.0</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center py-3">
                            <span class="text-body-secondary">Language version</span>
                            <span class="fw-semibold">C# 14.0</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="pb-5">
    <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-body p-4">
            <div class="row g-3 align-items-center">
                <div class="col-lg-4">
                    <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-0">Built for teams that want fast iteration without a custom design layer</p>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-8">
                    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-lg-end gap-2">
                        <span class="badge text-bg-light border text-dark">Responsive layout</span>
                        <span class="badge text-bg-light border text-dark">Bootstrap utilities</span>
                        <span class="badge text-bg-light border text-dark">Razor Pages routing</span>
                        <span class="badge text-bg-light border text-dark">Accessible components</span>
                        <span class="badge text-bg-light border text-dark">No custom CSS</span>
                        <span class="badge text-bg-light border text-dark">Docs-first maintenance</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="features" class="py-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center text-center mb-4 mb-lg-5">
        <div class="col-xl-8">
            <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-dark mb-3">Feature areas</span>
            <h2 class="display-6 fw-semibold mb-3">A landing page structure inspired by modern framework and component-library sites.</h2>
            <p class="lead text-body-secondary mb-0">The composition leans on strong section breaks, dense information cards, proof points, and direct calls to action while staying entirely inside Bootstrap&apos;s stock class system.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 row-cols-xl-3 g-4">
        <div class="col">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body p-4">
                    <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">Foundation</p>
                    <h3 class="h4">Clear hero and navigation</h3>
                    <p class="text-body-secondary mb-0">Lead with one message, a primary action, and lightweight navigation that maps directly to the main sections below.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body p-4">
                    <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">Product story</p>
                    <h3 class="h4">Explain the value in blocks</h3>
                    <p class="text-body-secondary mb-0">Use grouped cards to show what the app includes, what problems it solves, and what the platform assumptions are.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body p-4">
                    <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">Delivery model</p>
                    <h3 class="h4">Keep the frontend predictable</h3>
                    <p class="text-body-secondary mb-0">Everything on the page is built from standard containers, grids, badges, cards, buttons, and typography utilities.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body p-4">
                    <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">Scale</p>
                    <h3 class="h4">Add sections without redesigning</h3>
                    <p class="text-body-secondary mb-0">The page can grow with testimonials, pricing, changelogs, or product modules while keeping the same Bootstrap rhythm.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body p-4">
                    <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">Maintenance</p>
                    <h3 class="h4">No local theme drift</h3>
                    <p class="text-body-secondary mb-0">Removing custom CSS lowers the chance of one-off overrides and keeps component behavior consistent with Bootstrap documentation.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body p-4">
                    <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">Execution</p>
                    <h3 class="h4">Ship faster with fewer moving parts</h3>
                    <p class="text-body-secondary mb-0">You stay on one UI toolkit, one layout model, and one server-rendered application structure for the full page.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="platform" class="py-5">
    <div class="row g-4 g-xl-5 align-items-center">
        <div class="col-lg-6">
            <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light border text-dark mb-3">Platform fit</span>
            <h2 class="display-6 fw-semibold mb-3">A practical baseline for product, admin, and showcase pages.</h2>
            <p class="lead text-body-secondary mb-4">This app stays close to the defaults that Microsoft and Bootstrap document well, so future contributors can extend it without first reverse-engineering a custom theme or layout system.</p>
            <div class="list-group shadow-sm">
                <div class="list-group-item p-4">
                    <h3 class="h5 mb-2">Server-rendered by default</h3>
                    <p class="mb-0 text-body-secondary">Razor Pages keeps routing, handlers, and page structure straightforward for content-heavy screens and business apps.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="list-group-item p-4">
                    <h3 class="h5 mb-2">Bootstrap handles the UI system</h3>
                    <p class="mb-0 text-body-secondary">Spacing, layout, emphasis, and responsive behavior all come from standard utility and component classes.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="list-group-item p-4">
                    <h3 class="h5 mb-2">Clean upgrade path</h3>
                    <p class="mb-0 text-body-secondary">With .NET 10 and C# 14 pinned in the project, the baseline stays explicit and easier to keep current.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6">
            <div class="card border-0 shadow-lg">
                <div class="card-body p-4 p-lg-5">
                    <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-sm-2 g-3 mb-4">
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="card h-100 bg-body-tertiary border-0">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">App type</p>
                                    <p class="h5 mb-0">ASP.NET Core Web App</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="card h-100 bg-body-tertiary border-0">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">Rendering model</p>
                                    <p class="h5 mb-0">Razor Pages</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="card h-100 bg-body-tertiary border-0">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">UI layer</p>
                                    <p class="h5 mb-0">Bootstrap CDN</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="card h-100 bg-body-tertiary border-0">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">Authoring rule</p>
                                    <p class="h5 mb-0">No custom styles</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="alert alert-primary mb-4" role="alert">
                        <div class="fw-semibold mb-1">Recommended workflow</div>
                        Start with Bootstrap layout primitives, compose sections from cards and grids, and only add new content blocks when they can be expressed with existing classes.
                    </div>
                    <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-sm-3 g-3 text-center">
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="border rounded-3 h-100 p-3">
                                <div class="display-6 fw-bold">1</div>
                                <p class="mb-0 text-body-secondary">UI toolkit</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="border rounded-3 h-100 p-3">
                                <div class="display-6 fw-bold">0</div>
                                <p class="mb-0 text-body-secondary">Custom CSS files</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="border rounded-3 h-100 p-3">
                                <div class="display-6 fw-bold">100%</div>
                                <p class="mb-0 text-body-secondary">Bootstrap classes</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="pb-5">
    <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 row-cols-xl-4 g-4">
        <div class="col">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm text-center">
                <div class="card-body p-4">
