    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5">
    <div class="row g-4 align-items-stretch">
        <div class="col-lg-7">
            <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body p-4 p-lg-5">
                    <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-success mb-3">Why this works</span>
                    <h2 class="h1 mb-3">A tighter frontend surface means fewer surprises during delivery.</h2>
                    <p class="text-body-secondary mb-4">This setup is aimed at teams that want a professional landing page without introducing bespoke CSS, custom component wrappers, or a parallel design system that needs its own maintenance budget.</p>
                    <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 g-3">
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="border rounded-3 p-3 h-100">
                                <h3 class="h5">Familiar conventions</h3>
                                <p class="mb-0 text-body-secondary">Future contributors can rely on Bootstrap and Razor Pages docs instead of project-specific styling rules.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="border rounded-3 p-3 h-100">
                                <h3 class="h5">Consistent responsiveness</h3>
                                <p class="mb-0 text-body-secondary">Grid classes, container widths, and component defaults handle the mobile and desktop layout work.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-5">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body p-4 p-lg-5">
                    <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">Delivery note</p>
                    <blockquote class="blockquote mb-4">
                        <p class="mb-0">Use Bootstrap as the system, not just the dependency.</p>
                    </blockquote>
                    <p class="text-body-secondary mb-4">That constraint keeps the page coherent. Every section on this home page is composed from stock spacing, typography, border, color, and layout classes.</p>
                    <div class="d-grid gap-2">
                        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/examples/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Browse Bootstrap examples</a>
                        <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary" href="https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/layout/grid/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Review grid and layout docs</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

