            <h2 class="display-6 fw-semibold mb-2">Keep the page aligned with the platform.</h2>
            <p class="text-body-secondary mb-0">These references match the constraints used for this project: Razor Pages, Bootstrap latest, .NET 10, and no custom styling.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/introduction/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open Bootstrap quick start</a>
    </div>
    <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 row-cols-xl-3 g-4">
        <div class="col">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body p-4">
                    <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">Documentation</p>
                    <h3 class="h4">Razor Pages fundamentals</h3>
                    <p class="text-body-secondary">Use the official docs for routing, handlers, model binding, and page organization.</p>
                    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" href="https://learn.microsoft.com/aspnet/core/razor-pages/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open docs</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body p-4">
                    <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">UI reference</p>
                    <h3 class="h4">Bootstrap components and utilities</h3>
                    <p class="text-body-secondary">Reach for cards, badges, grids, buttons, alerts, navs, and typography utilities before inventing new patterns.</p>
                    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" href="https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/components/alerts/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Browse components</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body p-4">
                    <p class="small text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-2">Project baseline</p>
                    <h3 class="h4">Build on the current stack rules</h3>
                    <p class="text-body-secondary">Keep the app on Bootstrap latest, .NET 10, Razor Pages, and C# 14 unless the project direction changes deliberately.</p>
                    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" asp-page="/Privacy">View a secondary page</a>
                </div>
            </div>
